+  namespace_reader
  ' All callbacks receive a fully qualified target. An epoch belongs
  ' to that target's authority; there is no namespace-wide epoch.
  : page={\ care nat path}res[axal[myth]] epoch={\ care nat path}res[axal[myth]]
